@startuml audio_state
!theme cyborg
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
skinparam ArrowFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam state {
 BackgroundColor #273241
 BorderColor #61738a
 FontColor #e6edf7
 AttributeFontColor #cdd5d5
 BackgroundColor<<running>> #10302b
 BorderColor<<running>> #52c7b4
 BackgroundColor<<fault>> #2a1714
 BorderColor<<fault>> #f08a7c
 BackgroundColor<<unclear>> #3a3320
 BorderColor<<unclear>> #dcbb63
}
skinparam note {
 BackgroundColor #1b2533
 BorderColor #61738a
 FontColor #e6edf7
}
title L2_AUDIO states and the system states they correspond to
hide empty description
state "Initializing" as Initializing : i2s_initialize\nsystem: Boot
state "Stopped" as Stopped : no stream; output silent; waits for commands\nsystem: Idle, Portal, Analysing, Sending, ReportingError
state "Starting" as Starting : i2s_start: configure both links,\nprime 4 silent TX blocks, start RX, then TX\nsystem: still Idle (Listening starts at the started event)
state "Running" as Running <<running>> : block loop, one iteration per 4 ms, ≤ 3 ms (P02)\nsystem: Listening, Measuring (shared design: Live)
state "Stopping" as Stopping : i2s_stop (Stop sequence)\nsystem: Listening → Idle,\nMeasuring → Idle or Analysing
state "Fault" as Fault <<fault>> : both links dropped; waits for restart\nsystem: Muted (shared design: Error, audio affected)
[*] --> Initializing : boot
Initializing --> Stopped : both I2S controllers ready, links configured
Initializing --> Fault : I2S controller not ready or configuration failed\n/ failure reported to L2_CONTROL
Stopped --> Starting : Start command
Starting --> Running : priming and start succeed\n/ started event
Starting --> Fault : a link fails to start\n/ i2s_start drops both links, start failure reported
Running --> Stopping : Stop command, checked once per iteration
Stopping --> Stopped : / stopped event; all pool blocks free
Stopping --> Fault : a link rejects STOP or blocks stay in use\n/ i2s_abort, fault event with the failed link
Running --> Fault : receive or TX-block wait over 20 ms (P11),\ndriver error, for example > 12 ms behind\n/ i2s_abort, fault event with the failed link
Running --> Running : Wi-Fi-only fault\n/ audio preserved (P12)\nnon-audio halting fault\n/ latched, shown after manual Stop
Fault --> [*] : device restart (catalogue: restart required)
note bottom of Fault
  No automatic stream restart (decision of 11 November).
  The device is halted: every input, including Start,
  is blocked until restart (decision of 13 November).
end note
note left of Running
  Non-audio restart-required error during listening
  (SESSION_CONTEXT_CHANGE, CONTROL_INPUT_FAILURE,
  HEART_RATE_WORKER_STALL, SETTINGS_SAVE_FAILURE): AUDIO keeps
  running; the error is latched silently and shown
  after the manual Stop (decision of 13 November).
end note
note right of Starting
  The system enters Listening at the started
  event, not at the Start command (13 November).
end note
@enduml
